@host = http://localhost:5050

### Cadastrar Pizza
POST {{host}}/sabor
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "sabor": "Calabresa",
    "tempoPreparo": 10,
    "preco": 10.5
}

### Cadastrar Estoque
POST {{host}}/estoque
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "pizzaId": 1,
    "quantidade": 10
}

### Reduzir Estoque
PUT {{host}}/estoque/pizza/1/5